---
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Website Privacy | Synaptyx Manual Therapy"
  description="Information about inquiry forms, external booking providers, and video playback on the Synaptyx Manual Therapy website, formerly Total Tissue & Fitness."
  noindex
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="WEBSITE INFORMATION"
    title="Privacy & your information"
    description="This describes the current website data flow and does not replace an approved production privacy policy."
  />
  <article class="container prose section border-top">
    <h2>Inquiries</h2><p>
      The contact page uses Cloudflare Turnstile to check submissions. The name, email address,
      inquiry category, optional profession, and message you enter pass through the practice's
      inquiry service to the practice so it can respond. This website does not add them to the demo
      dashboard. Please do not submit medical or other sensitive health information. A full
      production privacy policy, retention schedule, and deletion process still need owner approval.
    </p><h2>Booking providers</h2><p>
      The booking page loads a Vagaro widget. Selecting a service or entering booking information
      takes place through Vagaro, which handles the appointment and confirmation. If you prefer, you
      can open Vagaro directly from the booking page. Review Vagaro’s privacy policy and terms
      before entering personal information.
    </p><h2>Video playback</h2><p>
      Videos are not loaded from YouTube until you choose to open a video player. Playback connects
      to YouTube’s privacy-enhanced embed service, which is governed by Google’s policies.
    </p><h2>Partner dashboard</h2><p>
      The dashboard is a publicly viewable demonstration containing fictional records. It does not
      have real accounts or permissions. Changes remain in the current page only and reset when you
      reload; no records are stored in a database or browser storage.
    </p><h2>Questions</h2><p>
      Use the <a href={withBase('/contact/')}>contact page</a> for general questions. Existing booking
      pathways are listed on the <a href={withBase('/book/')}>booking page</a>. A production privacy
      contact will be added before the site launches.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
